OL,3,GNEWSABrother and sister beaten in
OL,4,A'sickening' racist gang attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe sister of two people injured in a
OL,7,Fracially-motivated attack has described
OL,8,Fthe ordeal as "sickening" and has left
OL,9,Ftheir family deeply shaken.
OL,11,FThe woman said her brother and sister
OL,12,Fwere subjected to racial abuse before
OL,13,Fbeing attacked by a group of men, one
OL,14,Fof whom was armed with a baton.
OL,16,FPolice are treating three assaults and
OL,17,Fcriminal damage in the Waterside area
OL,18,Fof Londonderry on Sunday night as
OL,19,Fracially-motivated hate crimes and
OL,20,Fbelieve they may be linked.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
